# Trading Pod: development foundation, FX / OANDA practice only.
# Worker secrets belong in each worker's ignored .dev.vars (local)
# or Wrangler secrets (a separately authorised deployment).
#
# FC public configuration (wrangler.jsonc vars):
# TRADING_MODE=RESEARCH
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<public Google web client ID>
# DASHBOARD_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
#
# FC server-only configuration:
# DASHBOARD_ALLOWED_SUBJECTS=<comma-separated verified Google subject IDs>
# INTERNAL_SERVICE_SECRET=<service-to-service secret, never a VITE_ variable>
#
# No broker credentials are consumed in this milestone.
# OANDA v20 practice connection is the next milestone.
# Historical DASHBOARD_TOKEN and browser service secrets are retired.
